  ability1Names:
  - Chesapeake Explorer
  - Coureur des Bois
  - Conquistador
  - Merchant Convoy Escort
  - Donatary captaincy
  ability1Descriptions:
  - Explorer Units reveal +1 Hex of unexplored territory
  - French Colonies with Fur produce +2 Fur
  - Spanish Military Units gain +2 Combat Strength when fighting Native Factions
  - Dutch Cargo Ships escorted by a Dutch Naval Unit gain +2 Gold when trading with
    Europe
  - 'Newly founded Colonies start with +1 Food and +1 Sugar.

    The first Colony
    established each game requires 1 fewer Turn'
  ability2Icons:
  - {fileID: -4747797648084286164, guid: 1a3d1c67c7d751d49b20a32c76fb725b, type: 3}
