  - Cartographer of New France
  - Seven Cities of Gold
  - Raid on the Medway
  - Brazilwood Expedition
  ability2Descriptions:
  - Colonies produce +3 Food per Turn
  - French Explorer Units gain +1 Visual Range
  - Capturing an enemy Colony grants +50 Gold
  - Dutch Naval Units gain +2 Combat Strength when attacking enemy Naval Units
  - Forest Hexes produce +1 Lumber
